<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post5426851071824749025..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Mike Nifong: Your Time Is Coming....</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5426851071824749025/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/01/mike-nifong-your-time-is-coming.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>3</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4615946855895565606</id><published>2007-01-25T11:40:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-01-25T11:40:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>will,&#xa;&#xa;interesting piece. did you know that there&#39;...</title><content type='html'>will,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;interesting piece. did you know that there&#39;s a series of games for the nintendo DS lite called phoenix wright ace attorney? in it you play a defense lawyer trying to get your clients declared not guilty. in the game, all of your clients are innocent (except for one case in the second series).  what you are up against are prosecutors who will do anything to get your client declared guilty.  they withhold evidence, tell clients not to bring up certain issues, and the list goes on.  how....coincidental.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;the first game ends with the lead prosecutor taking a leave of absence after he finally realized that getting a guilty verdict is not what being a prosecutor is about, but rather a fair trial is more important.  he even helped the defense in the last case after it became obvious that the defense&#39;s client was innocent, and get this, the police chief was guilty of the murder. man, someone thought that game out.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;it&#39;s no wonder that game is already on it&#39;s sixth printing and is really hard to find.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5426851071824749025/comments/default/4615946855895565606'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5426851071824749025/comments/default/4615946855895565606'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/01/mike-nifong-your-time-is-coming.html?showComment=1169750400000#c4615946855895565606' title=''/><author><name>rick</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12473173027048173880</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/01/mike-nifong-your-time-is-coming.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5426851071824749025' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5426851071824749025' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-870704727"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 25, 2007 at 11:40 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8799381523016321464</id><published>2007-01-25T11:08:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-01-25T11:08:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Mr. Nifong apparently is not yet sufficiently chas...</title><content type='html'>Mr. Nifong apparently is not yet sufficiently chastened, so perhaps some of your suggestions (or Wayne&#39;s) are in order.  His &lt;a href=&quot;http://abcnews.go.com/US/LegalCenter/story?id=2821711&amp;page=1&quot;&gt;lawyer says &lt;/a&gt;that if Nifong had it to do all over again, he&#39;d still prosecute.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5426851071824749025/comments/default/8799381523016321464'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5426851071824749025/comments/default/8799381523016321464'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/01/mike-nifong-your-time-is-coming.html?showComment=1169748480000#c8799381523016321464' title=''/><author><name>Mike Tennant</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13611178541779786030</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/01/mike-nifong-your-time-is-coming.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5426851071824749025' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5426851071824749025' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1574052114"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 25, 2007 at 11:08 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8069104728291701709</id><published>2007-01-24T19:52:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-01-24T19:52:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>As able as those young men are, they should &quot;confr...</title><content type='html'>As able as those young men are, they should &quot;confront&quot; Mr. Nifong. At night, with all black clothing and matching black stockings on their heads. It would be a wonderful thing. Nothing permanent, possibly something quite embarassing. I&#39;m sure they&#39;re bright enough to think up something. Just the musings of someone who once was accused of something he didn&#39;t do and wasn&#39;t believed. Feeling much better now.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5426851071824749025/comments/default/8069104728291701709'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5426851071824749025/comments/default/8069104728291701709'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/01/mike-nifong-your-time-is-coming.html?showComment=1169693520000#c8069104728291701709' title=''/><author><name>Wayne in PA</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07798187933045157968</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/01/mike-nifong-your-time-is-coming.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5426851071824749025' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5426851071824749025' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-26911455"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 24, 2007 at 7:52 PM"/></entry></feed>